This is a placeholder file for the app icon.
Replace this with an actual PNG icon (512x512 recommended) before building for production.

For now, you can:
1. Create a simple icon using any graphic design tool
2. Use an online icon generator
3. Or use a temporary emoji/symbol as the app icon

The icon will be used for:
- Application window
- macOS dock
- Menu bar tray
- DMG installer
